# CLI-upload exclusions (vercel deploy). Gitignore semantics — all patterns
# anchored to repo root with a leading slash, so nested app dirs like
# src/lib/omnigent are never caught by accident.
/.next-preview
# Local build output — Vercel builds from source. `.next/cache/webpack/*.pack`
# routinely exceeds the CLI's 100MB per-file upload limit.
/.next

# Not needed to build/serve the app — keep uploads lean.
/graphify-out
/Design
/omnigent
/core
/services
/src-tauri
/docs
*.sqlite3
*.sqlite3-shm
*.sqlite3-wal
/tsconfig.tsbuildinfo
